WEBVTT

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.310
Tsujigiri Nagiri has appeared
in this town.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.360
A vampire with a danger
level over Level A,

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:28.650
"Wanted Vampire"

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:28.650
A vampire with a danger
level over Level A,

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.070
"Wanted Vampire"

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.070
whose indiscriminate attacks have
put him on the national wanted list.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.280
We request the cooperation
of the Hunters Guild.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.990
However, Tsujigiri is an
extremely dangerous vampire.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:42.700
He slashes his victims with a blade
formed from his own blood

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.410
and draws out their blood.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.750
That ability is something
to be feared, too,

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.000
but what should be feared
most is his immortality.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.590
Using supernatural means,

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:54.300
he's separated his soul, if you could call
it that, from his body and hidden it.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.340
As long as that isn't destroyed,

00:00:56.340 --> 00:01:01.600
Tsujigiri won't budge, even if he's staked
or exposed to sunlight. He's immortal.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:06.560
Therefore, the goal is to arrest him
and find and destroy his "soul."

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.400
I'd like you to help me defeat Tsujigiri
and protect this town!

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:43.120
"The Longest Day of Tsujigiri Nagiri"

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:47.040
"The Longest Day of Tsujigiri Nagiri"

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:47.040
Jeez, what are Ronaldo and the others
rushing around for this time?

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:48.370
Jeez, what are Ronaldo and the others
rushing around for this time?

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:52.830
Anyway, you seem to like
digging holes, huh, John?

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:55.750
Hm? What's wrong, John?

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:58.720
What is this?

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:05.310
A small coffin? Inside is...

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.060
...a doll, huh?

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.480
I feel like I've seen something like
this before... What was it again?

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.020
I think it's something you
aren't supposed to touch...

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.440
But it looks fun,
so I'll take it home with me!

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:20.950
I'm the type who'll keep pushing
buttons I'm told not to push.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.120
"Vampire - Tsujigiri Nagiri"

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.250
What?

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.750
I-It's gone!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.550
My spirit effigy!

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.260
For someone to carry it off
in such a short amount of time...

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.850
Was it a hunter with
investigative abilities?

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.890
Where's the bad vampire?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.020
We'll get rid of it!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:53.810
It's dark and creepy around here.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.480
Hey, old man! What're you doing?

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.570
There's a vampire alert out
right now, so it's dangerous!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.980
You little brats-- Ack!

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:02.200
Old man!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.820
Oh, no.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:08.370
Look at that hand!
This is that dangerous vampire!

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.870
Seriously? Let's be the ones to beat him!
He looks weakened for some reason, too.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.920
But isn't it dangerous?

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.420
Then, what if we just harass him a little?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:21.210
All right, let's cover him
with starch glue!

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.800
Stop it, you brats!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:27.390
Bastards, I'll slash you all--

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.810
Th-They're fast...

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:36.730
M-My spirit effigy is being hurt!
I need to get it back as soon as possible!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:41.030
I'm back! Hey, Ronaldo,
I found this weird thin--

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.990
Huh? He's not here...
Did he get a job?

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:49.120
I guess I'll wait for him, then.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:53.160
"Master's Daughter - Koyuki"
Would you like something to drink?

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:57.420
Hot milk, please. Put it on Ronaldo's tab.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:01.170
All right, I can feel my
spirit effigy close by.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.260
The Vampire Control Division!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:05.300
Damn it, she's in the way.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.840
Should I cut her down to get through?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.430
Who's there?!

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:15.060
"Alcohol Wipes"

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:15.060
Did I burn you? I'm sorry.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.310
"Alcohol Wipes"

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.310
No, no, don't worry about it. Wipe, wipe.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:25.490
Ow! That stings! M-My eyes! Stop it!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.740
What's with this drunkard?!

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:32.330
Wh-Who are you calling drunk?!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.750
Excuse me. This was in the way.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.920
Listen, and listen good, lady.
My name is...

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.170
...Tsuji-- Argh!

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:44.260
Wh-What's the matter, Tsuji-argh?!
Hang in there, Tsuji-argh!

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:49.800
N-No, that's not it... A-Anyway,
d-don't talk to me right now...

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:53.560
Are you feeling unwell?
Do you need an ambulance?

00:05:53.560 --> 00:06:00.940
That's... n-not necessary...
b-because right now, you... you're...

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.360
You can tell me after you've
calmed down a bit.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:06.150
You don't need to pay for it.
I just found it somewhere.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.700
But it's wet...

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:11.070
Right here, right now, you and me--

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.330
We could take off the wet clothes... Oops.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.210
A-Are you a pervert?!
An elaborate exhibitionist?!

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.670
N-No! I'm really not!

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.630
Oh, Dral, what's that?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:28.550
Oh.... um... I found this doll,
but the clothes got dirty.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.680
Oh, the poor thing!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:37.350
You little... Why the clothes?!
I can't move around as I wish like this.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:42.360
A-Anyway, I need some kind
of clothes! Clothes... Clothes...!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:48.700
You pervert!

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:49.990
--Oh, this is perfect!

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.610
--Right?
--Oh, this is perfect!

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:55.080
Eccentric Exhibitionist! Public indecency!
You're coming to the station with me!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:59.620
N-No...! I-I at least want
to be caught as myself!

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.460
It's pretty cute.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.420
Where did you go, damn vampire?!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.960
Sand!

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:09.590
Over there! My spirit effigy
is over there!

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.340
How dare you toy with me like this!

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:14.640
Bastard, what are you playing at?!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.600
N-Nothing--

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.810
How was the patrol?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.020
O-Oh, we couldn't find Tsujigiri...

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.530
I'm glad you're okay, though.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.820
Too close! Too close!

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.120
That Tsujigiri Nagiri bastard
appeared in Shin-Yoko!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.870
What? No way! Someone like
that was around here?!

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.790
That's scary! Sand...

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.120
Who was this guy, anyway?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.090
Bosatsu! Come out, Bosatsu!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.170
"Cats Are Cute"

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.170
Bosatsu! Come out, Bosatsu!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.260
"Cats Are Cute"

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.260
How's it going, Ronaldo?

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:55.680
Not good. He got behind the plumbing...

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.760
That's inconvenient.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.470
Before he defecates in there or somethin--

00:07:58.470 --> 00:07:59.520
Sand!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.560
What's wrong?! Did a vampire appear?!

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.400
Wh-What are you doing?

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.190
I came to observe Draluc.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:08.150
I meant, why did you come
out of the floor, moron?!

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:11.860
Last time, that idiot Handa came in my
place without asking, so I thought I'd--

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.110
Don't tell me you made a path
down there without asking.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.910
What is wrong with you people?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.700
--So I thought I'd formally--
--Anyway, what about your other work?

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.160
You have a lot of free time or something?

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.830
S-Sorry about that...

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.170
Long time no see, beautiful young lady--

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.880
Shut up. I'm disappointed in you.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:30.130
Sand! What?! Did I do something?

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:33.220
Well? What were you guys doing?

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:37.640
Oh, a stray cat from the neighborhood
got lost in this building.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:41.100
He always looks like he's smiling,
so we call him "Bosatsu."

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.770
But he won't come out even when we call.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.900
Maybe he doesn't like you.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.480
--You didn't have to say it like that...

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.570
--All right, I'll help, too!
--You didn't have to say it like that...

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:52.900
Thanks. You must have a
lot of free time on your hands.

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.200
--Free time... He said I have free time...

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:57.410
--Stop playing around, you two. Hurry up!
--Free time... He said I have free time...

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.660
What should we do?
We can't sprinkle water around here.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.330
Poke him with a stick?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.210
It might have the opposite effect
if we scare him, though.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.710
What if we have John talk to him?

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:13.010
John. Convince the cat to go outside.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.220
Huh? What's wrong, John?

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.930
It looks like his back is caught.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.270
John...!

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.600
H-Hurry up and pull him out!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.770
Maybe Bosatsu was scared because
an armadillo appeared suddenly.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:31.270
Wouldn't it be better
to lure him out with food?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.360
I have leftover cookies I baked yesterday.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:38.200
He's not a hamster.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:43.080
Bastard... What are these...?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.830
Welcome home. Dinner's ready.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.080
Right, I'll have some.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.960
You little-- Are you trying
to deceive me again?!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:53.710
No, I was trying to use it as cat food.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:58.300
Well, it's probably faster to scare him
and chase him out somehow.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:00.350
What if we make a loud sound?

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:00.550
Oh, how about this?

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.300
"1. Kill Draluc"

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.300
Oh, how about this?

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.060
"1. Kill Draluc"

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.060
"2. Pour him in through cracks"

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:02.890
"1. Kill Draluc"
"2. Pour him in through cracks"

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:02.890
"3. Cat comes out"

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:06.640
You just want to do Step 1, don't you?!

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:10.060
You don't respect my life!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:12.980
Okay, Hinaichi. You catch the cat
when he's running away.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:14.980
Leave it to me!

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:21.240
S-Stop it, cat! Wait-- Sand!
Ouch, ouch! Sand! So cramped! Sand!

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.580
Bite.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.290
Sand...

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.160
He's just getting killed over and over.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.210
Is this hell?

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.710
That's not it! Ronaldo, this guy is--

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:31.960
Meow.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.170
Here he is, Hinaichi!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.590
All right, come here, Bosatsu!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.130
Get away! That cat's a vampire!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:42.300
What?! Hey, Hinaichi, are you all right?!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.060
I love cats!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:47.180
What's wrong?!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:51.310
"Vampire Cat - Bosatsu"
Now, my servant, capture those two.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:52.900
Yes, Master Bosatsu.

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.820
She's being controlled!

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:58.610
That guy! Even though he's a cat,
he can hypnotize people!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.860
Seriously? He's better than you.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:04.660
Be quiet! Hurry up and get
that cat away from Hinaichi!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:08.580
Sorry, Bosatsu! Please come quietly!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.960
Ronaldo!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:18.920
It's no use. Give up
and become my servant.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.260
Why are you doing this, Bosatsu?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.140
Isn't it obvious?

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:29.430
With my hypnosis, I will make
all of humanity into cat lovers!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.810
Humans are cats' slaves.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:35.570
They will be degraded to beings whose
only purpose is to open cans of cat food.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:38.820
Man, this cat had bigger
ambitions than I expected.

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:43.660
How about it? If you submit to me,
then I will let you pet my butt.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.530
I-I won't do something like that!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.410
He looks like he wants to, though...

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:50.960
That's right, Ronaldo!
Hurry up and become a cat lover, too!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.460
If you do, then, you know--

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.340
You'll think cats are...
cute... so cute...

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:57.210
You're so bad at this!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:12:00.670
Shut up! I'll turn you into a cat lover
even if I have to use brute force!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:05.260
Get a hold of yourself,
Vampire Control Division!

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:09.970
Damn it... She's really strong...

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.140
Hey, are you all right, Ronaldo?

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.400
John!

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:19.440
J-John... if you were bitten back then...

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:25.370
R-Ronaldo...

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.620
I love cats...

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:30.660
Ronaldo!

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:35.880
You're the only one left,
my feeble compatriot.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.210
How can a cat call me compatriot?!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:42.760
It's annoying, but it looks like
my hypnosis doesn't work on you,

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:46.510
so I'll capture you
and use you as kitty litter.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.970
No way!

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:51.730
Wait a minute, Master Bosatsu.
The only thing that guy can do is cook.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:53.390
His cookies were delicious!

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.480
It'd be a waste to make
him into kitty litter.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.190
Very well.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:59.440
Then three days a week, he'll be my chef,

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.030
and he can be kitty litter
four days a week.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:04.820
Do you guys want to eat food
cooked by a toilet?!

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:09.280
That's enough of your impertinent talk.
I've got you, Draluc.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:16.670
How foolish. Cats sit atop
this world, after all... Hm?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.960
A phone?

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:22.710
You got carried away, cat!
This is the end for you!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.590
What?!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.510
What did you do, Draluc--?!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:29.010
What was the urgent business, Draluc?

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.310
Hm?

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:34.230
Ronaldo, if you sleep here,
you'll catch a cold.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:37.230
Wh-Who is this man?

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:41.900
Do you see him? He's our lethal weapon!
Autumn's young assassin!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:44.440
His whole body's a battle axe!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:47.200
Now, Mr. Fukuma, show that cat--

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:48.370
So cute!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:49.990
What?!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:52.200
I love cats.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:55.080
Oh, no, today's humanity's last day!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.750
Now, you will become a cornerstone
of my plan to rule over humanity--

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.050
Stop! Stop!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.130
I...

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:13.100
I can't stand for a cat's precious heart
to be broken by humans...

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.350
You are mine, and mine alone.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:18.940
I will do everything to
bring you perfect joy.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:21.900
I will make a paradise just for us.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:27.900
Now, let us go... to a place where you
will be treasured for all eternity.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:31.780
Hey, w-wait a minute--

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.870
Huh? What was I doing...?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:45.010
Jeez, I can't believe that happened
with a hunter and Vamp Control around.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.510
I-I am ashamed...

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:50.300
Shut up! You didn't do anything, either!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.430
Excuse me.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:55.600
M-M-Mr. Fukuma! Sorry for causing
you trouble the other day!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.390
Don't worry about it.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.140
Oh, what's in that cage?

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:02.940
It's Bosatsu.
I decided to keep him as a pet.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:06.740
Oh, is he okay? Does he get
out of control, or anything?

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.900
No, he's a very good cat.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:12.870
Sand!

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:15.790
Bosatsu, is your new home fun?

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:22.000
Yes, it is fun... I'm glad
you let me be your pet...

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:31.010
"Handa, Day Off, History"
Hmm, I've completed the event
and gotten all the items.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:36.770
Anyway, Ronaldo's taking a long time.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:39.230
He said he was just going to Vamima.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.190
Is he reading <i>Champion</i>
in the store or somethi--?

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.810
Vampire Draluc!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:44.150
Sand!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:47.730
H-Handa! Are you here to search the house
again under the pretext of surveillance?

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.360
You fool! I'm off duty today.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:52.410
If you're off duty, then why are you here?

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:54.280
Isn't it obvious?

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:58.080
First, last time, the two of us
presented a united front.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:02.330
And you're a vampire,
and I'm a dhampir.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.670
Do I have to spell it out for you?

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:07.170
I-I don't get it at all!
Give me a hint.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.460
Hint #1. I came over to hang out.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.680
W-Welcome.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.090
Someone strange has
taken a liking to me...

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:18.140
Ronaldo isn't home yet.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:21.430
He can just stay out! I don't want
him to butt in on my day off!

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.560
So in order to keep him
from getting close,

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.980
I've placed celery traps
all around this building.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.110
"The entrance is covered with celery"
"Hurry up, I can't get inside"

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.110
I've placed celery traps
all around this building.

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:30.360
"The entrance is covered with celery"
"Hurry up, I can't get inside"

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:30.360
It must be true. I've got a ton
of messages asking for help.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.110
I know there's the thing with your mom,
but you don't kid around, huh?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.990
Mom-- No, it's not just about my mother!

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:39.080
He's always been my enemy.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:41.830
Oh, yeah, you two went to
high school together, right?

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:45.130
Interesting! Will you tell me
about the good old days?

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.040
"Record of My Fights with
My Sworn Enemy Ronaldo"

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.420
"Record of My Fights with
