00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.420
You hedonist busybody.
Fine, I'll tell you of his foolish past.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:53.220
"Record of My Fights with
My Sworn Enemy Ronaldo"

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:53.220
Whoa, this is what they use
in meetings! Scary!

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:56.340
You idiot! You're the one
who wanted to hear about it!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.140
Shut up and check the documents quickly!

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.770
Hey, what is that? Do you carry
that around with you?

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.100
You don't want to hear about it?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.270
I <i>really </i>want to hear about it.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.690
Very well!

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.770
Now, I will begin!
Be quiet during the screening!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.690
Right, I'll turn my phone to silent.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.030
Let's see, first--

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:12.990
What's that?!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:16.200
As a hook, I have a slideshow of
Ronaldo's disgraceful behavior.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.450
Skip it, please.

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:21.290
Tell me more about the
start of your rivalry.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:24.870
Damn it, fine. I'll tell you.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:27.170
On the first day of school--

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.880
Handa! You wanna join Vamp Control, right?

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.670
I wanna be a hunter.
Look forward to working with you.

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:35.260
You think you can compete with me?
You don't know your place!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.050
Before I go after vampires,
I'm gonna go after you!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:41.470
And so, I understood that he
was a man to be defeated.

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:44.930
Ronaldo got caught up
with a landmine, huh?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.560
He wasn't caught up in anything!

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:49.940
I just thought I should crush any
future business rivals early!

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:53.150
It's unusual to see someone who seems
to have as few friends as you.

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.490
Since then, I started acting
to defeat Ronaldo.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:59.450
The gloomiest active adolescence ever!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.030
By taking blood pills,

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:06.250
we dhampirs are able to temporarily
boost our physical abilities.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:10.250
Using these abilities, I dug pitfalls
on Ronaldo's route to school!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.170
"Ronaldo's backpack is lame"

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.170
Misuse of powers!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.800
"Ronaldo's backpack is lame"

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.800
Wrote propaganda using desks!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:16.550
And bought all the bread at the
school store before Ronaldo could!

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:17.260
Does that have anything
to do with your abilities?

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.590
"School Store Bread"

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.590
Does that have anything
to do with your abilities?

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:19.140
"Stonefly Larvae Bread"

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:19.140
Does that have anything
to do with your abilities?

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:20.970
"Stonefly Larvae Bread"

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:20.970
Who took these pictures?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.100
"Stonefly Larvae Bread"

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.100
There was a newspaper club member
that always followed me around.

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.430
"Extra! Handa's Strange Behavior Today"

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.430
There was a newspaper club member
that always followed me around.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.890
"Extra! Handa's Strange Behavior Today"

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.890
You're being exposed in the article!

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:30.770
These are the chronicles of how
you caused trouble for Ronaldo.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:34.280
What do you mean, "caused trouble"? Fool!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.650
Then, why don't I tell you
about how I saved that guy?

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:39.110
Oh?

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:40.160
Ever since then, he has been no match.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.120
"Hurry up and help. Clean this up.
Hurry up and come do it"
"Answer your phone!!!!!!!"

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.120
Ever since then, he has been no match.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.660
"Hurry up and help. Clean this up.
Hurry up and come do it"
"Answer your phone!!!!!!!"

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.660
Let me hear it!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:47.620
One day, around sunset...

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.670
Hurry up and carry it, Ronaldo!

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:54.130
<i>You're </i>the one who said you'd clean up.
Why do <i>I </i>have to do it, too, damn it?

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:56.460
Ronaldo, look this way, please.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:59.130
<i>You </i>help, too, Kameya.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:00.970
I'll let you do the rest.

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:04.060
Are you stupid?
You stay until it's done, too.

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.270
Oh, no! Someone stuck a shovel
in the door handles.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.190
Seriously?

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.650
Form a scrum! Let's break down the door!

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.980
We can't. It's metal.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:17.780
If we wait, a teacher will
see us on their rounds.

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:19.360
You're not alert enough to danger!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.490
I can't believe you think you can
be a hunter like that, Ronaldo!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.830
What does that have to do with
anything?! You're too close!

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:29.080
Yeah, it's not like there's
a vampire here.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.880
"[Land Clione]"
"Inferior vampire. Feeds using the mouth on
its head. It messily melts away clothes and things
that are in the way and sucks just the blood."

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.300
What <i>is </i>this thing?!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.800
A vampire! What's it doing here?!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.300
Kameya!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.850
T-Take a picture for me with
the whole body in the picture!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.640
The flash setting's fine as-is.

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:48.930
Whoa, Kameya, you can definitely be a pro!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.560
Get away! You bastard!

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.440
Are you all right, Kameya?

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:58.530
I-I'm fine... I just had some
blood sucked out of me...

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:00.030
But my clothes are a little melted...

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:02.700
Kameya...!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:05.490
Take a picture of me...
I'll use it as a victim photo...

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:09.370
Treat yourself better, Kameya!

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:12.500
C-Crap, we'll all look like
we're wearing high-leg clothes!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:16.170
Calm down, you idiot!
You call yourself a future hunter?

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:19.130
Before whining about it,
you should defeat this guy!

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:22.630
B-But how? Kicking it
didn't seem to do anything.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:24.590
I have a plan.

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:27.390
Ten seconds. Get that guy's attention!

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.810
R-Right!

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:32.060
Damn it, you bastard!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:38.650
Let go, you bastard!

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:49.160
Did you see that, fool?
Most vampires are weak to fire.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:51.620
Th-Thanks for saving me, Handa...

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:56.460
Ideally... it would've been nice if
you'd done it a little sooner, though.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:21:02.720
Hey, is anyone in there?
Did you get locked in?

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.090
It's not what you think!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:07.350
--Hey, what're you doing?!
--No, there was a vampire here!
Right, Handa?! He's gone!

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:10.600
--Kameya, too?! What kind of ritual
is this?! Men's Sabbath?!
--No, there was a vampire here!
Right, Handa?! He's gone!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.680
It's not a sabbath!

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.230
That was something that happened.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:18.570
It's hard to tell if Ronaldo
was actually saved, though.

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:23.280
But I think Ronaldo does feel like
he's in some debt to you.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.950
Of course.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.160
But why would an inferior vampire
be in a place like that?

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.990
Because I brought it there!

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:32.290
The culprit!

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:35.750
Ronaldo was the only one who was supposed
to be trapped there, but I messed up.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:37.920
But it turned out okay in the end!

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:42.210
It was hilarious watching that clueless
guy thank me in that high-leg outfit.

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.810
You think we can get them to pay
for the window this time?

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:53.310
That might be a little hard.

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:56.140
"Cruel"

00:21:56.140 --> 00:21:57.520
"Game"

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:59.020
"Begins"

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:01.520
We're up against my family.

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:03.650
I'm a <i>hunter</i>, you know!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:11.080
He's the strongest,
most troublesome vampire in the family.

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:16.080
The vampire dies in no time.
